{
"file": 98,
"paths": [
"d007/d001/f305"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "55891690",
"en_raw": "Hey, Murase"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "761f2126",
"en_raw": "Can I say something weird?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "fbb810a6",
"en_raw": "What?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "3ee1eb80",
"en_raw": "So it's Shiina after all?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "04fec655",
"en_raw": "...Why, what do you mean"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "c23a1a30",
"en_raw": "It's not Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "ff477d8a",
"en_raw": "but Kurumi Shiina"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "4dc4b22d",
"en_raw": "It's not that I don't get it"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "457245ed",
"en_raw": "but it nags at me"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "eb61d51d",
"en_raw": "Sanjo"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "89af8d68",
"en_raw": "So what do you"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "2dc0a2a2",
"en_raw": "I mean, on walks"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "0e51b3d7",
"en_raw": "Hirauchi's with you too, right?"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "ab71ec37",
"en_raw": "That's Sango doing it on her own..."
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "55891690",
"en_raw": "Hey, Murase"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "41b2787c",
"en_raw": "It's a weird question, but"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "fbb810a6",
"en_raw": "What?"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "a314967a",
"en_raw": "Murase"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "397245c0",
"en_raw": "...Who gets to call you Nao?"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "e47bea76",
"en_raw": "What right do they have?"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "4e544082",
"en_raw": "Right?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "d1f895f8",
"en_raw": "...There's no such thing"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "0356e09a",
"en_raw": "Talking a lot, being close"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "d20dda46",
"en_raw": "something like that..."
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "bbbd2216",
"en_raw": "But Shinta Segawa and others"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "1a914bda",
"en_raw": "call you Murase-kun, right?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "d4202693",
"en_raw": "Kume does too"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "9598582d",
"en_raw": "And me, I..."
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "0f852ee0",
"en_raw": "No, it doesn't matter"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "c6132170",
"en_raw": "anyone can call you whatever"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "ad8f9191",
"en_raw": "Is that okay?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "524fc0f0",
"en_raw": "Yes"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "856de559",
"en_raw": "Then me too?"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "524fc0f0",
"en_raw": "Yes"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "78ca80f7",
"en_raw": "Then..."
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "af159c95",
"en_raw": "Never mind"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "559582ca",
"en_raw": "It feels weird coming from me"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "875ed735",
"en_raw": "It'd be weird to suddenly change"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "e580a29a",
"en_raw": "The usual way is fine"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "06fd8145",
"en_raw": "Right"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "68699c7c",
"en_raw": "Sorry for the weird talk"
}
]
}